{
  "ci": {
    "collect": {
      "url": [
        "http://localhost:3001/login",
        "http://localhost:3001/",
        "http://localhost:3001/devices",
        "http://localhost:3001/records",
        "http://localhost:3001/analytics",
        "http://localhost:3001/map",
        "http://localhost:3001/roles",
        "http://localhost:3001/platform",
        "http://localhost:3001/stream-types"
      ],
      "numberOfRuns": 1,
      "settings": {
        "preset": "desktop",
        "skipAudits": [
          "uses-http2",
          "canonical",
          "is-crawlable"
        ]
      },
      "_comment": "Routes as they actually ship. `/sessions` was dropped in M24 W2: NEP was switched off in M15 W4 and the nav entry is flag-gated off, so the budget was gating a page no user can reach while every route built in M16-M23 (records, analytics, map, roles, platform, stream-types) had no budget at all."
    },
    "assert": {
      "assertMatrix": [
        {
          "_comment": "Every route EXCEPT the bare dashboard root. LHCI applies every matching entry, so this must not also match '/' or its strict CLS rule would override the documented carve-out below.",
          "matchingUrlPattern": "^http://localhost:3001/.+",
          "assertions": {
            "categories:performance": [
              "error",
              {
                "minScore": 0.8
              }
            ],
            "categories:accessibility": [
              "error",
              {
                "minScore": 0.95
              }
            ],
            "categories:best-practices": [
              "warn",
              {
                "minScore": 0.9
              }
            ],
            "largest-contentful-paint": [
              "error",
              {
                "maxNumericValue": 2500
              }
            ],
            "cumulative-layout-shift": [
              "error",
              {
                "maxNumericValue": 0.1
              }
            ],
            "total-blocking-time": [
              "error",
              {
                "maxNumericValue": 400
              }
            ],
            "unused-javascript": [
              "warn",
              {
                "maxNumericValue": 250000
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "The live dashboard: charts + a WebGL map + a socket, so it is both the heaviest route and the noisiest to measure. Its budgets carry headroom over the observed run-to-run spread deliberately \u2014 a gate that fails at random gets switched off, which is worse than a looser one that means something. CLS is a warn: a known, documented gap (see LIGHTHOUSE.md).",
          "matchingUrlPattern": "^http://localhost:3001/$",
          "assertions": {
            "categories:performance": [
              "error",
              {
                "minScore": 0.7
              }
            ],
            "categories:accessibility": [
              "error",
              {
                "minScore": 0.95
              }
            ],
            "largest-contentful-paint": [
              "error",
              {
                "maxNumericValue": 3000
              }
            ],
            "total-blocking-time": [
              "error",
              {
                "maxNumericValue": 800
              }
            ],
            "cumulative-layout-shift": [
              "warn",
              {
                "maxNumericValue": 0.1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "upload": {
      "target": "filesystem",
      "outputDir": ".lighthouseci"
    }
  }
}
